    "collapsible_tabs_zY8rXT": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "item_MfkmQz": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "Do you ship overseas?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Yes, JoyCraft Haven ships worldwide! Shipping costs will be automatically calculated and added at checkout. Be sure to stay tuned for our year-round discounts and exclusive promotions. ✈️</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_i6CRBq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How long will it take to receive my order?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Depending on your region, standard shipping usually takes 7-10 days. Our packages are shipped from China, and most orders arrive within about a week. Once your order has been dispatched, JoyCraft Haven will send you a notification email so you can easily track its progress. 🚚</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_9MimeP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "What is your return policy?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>JoyCraft Haven accepts returns on most products. If you aren't completely satisfied with your purchase, you can request a return within 7 days of receiving your order. Please ensure the item is unused, in its original packaging, and still has all its original tags.<br/>⚠️ Please note: Customized products and Mystery Boxes are final sale and non-refundable.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_BxNi6M": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How do I track my package?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>You can easily track your order using any of these methods:<br/><br/>Click the \"Track Your Package\" link in the footer at the bottom of our website.<br/><br/>Log into your account and view the tracking number on the \"My Orders\" page, or find it in your shipping confirmation email.<br/><br/>Enter your tracking number on our tracking page to view real-time delivery updates.</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_iKQADU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How can I participate in promotions or get discounts?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>It's very easy! Simply add qualifying items to your cart. Once your order total meets the required amount, the discount will be automatically applied at checkout—no promo code needed. ✨</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
